{"summary":"Balance the ball on wooden bridges, avoid obstacles, and reach the boat safely!","description":"Extreme Balancer 3 is an exciting and challenging game where you have to balance a ball on narrow wooden bridges and guide it safely to the end of each level. Be careful, if the ball falls off, you will have to start over! The game has beautiful 3D graphics and realistic physics that make it feel like you are really balancing the ball.\n\nKey Features:\n- Challenging Levels: Test you ball balancing skills with the levels that get harder as you go.\n- Realistic Physics: Experience lifelike ball physics that make every movement and obstacle feel real.\n- Beautiful 3D Graphics: Explore stunning environments as you roll through different worlds.\n- Simple Controls: Easy-to-use controls let you focus on the game.\n- Addictive Fun: Once you start, you won't want to stop until you have conquered every level!\n\nDownload Extreme Balancer 3 now and see if you have what it takes to keep the ball from falling!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$1.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bgPcFlO8LB4?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F339zHmAVsi08XANcJIjdNtgHZvCZG-hdg0WDUVt6OZirNmPq_pFgjlZgmnPNyruaJ676gFSZh0dB34uh-L9","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DanPExgMOyUgkh8_9hBk6U_J0xEh9FnDZjxizPLIW3mk59f2QO-nBV5263QgBzaf1rRVi5E5zKYz8ZpPxRUoiq4","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qXNYr_syKb24O-jcP9n2UJ1UF3dbL7hnVzDNmhkQD6FInU_67EzrAMFpqNTn09SemhzIT98uXTjg-DoWRf89nBs","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UzJzx6P9Y8IZV4bLpoMQ4oe4nS8vSBRbkMac1wtNmep3qKuJAsr6hGOhErs8IiA6WvPx8-5uaAF4GK153zZa","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c9EPXlSTp9RB_7GwEau0iV4As_gE1A4KfI1ekny_i0q04DdtYCsofBnS8zLrXZjormg8myOWXEw26H6Q-B33jJo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/P8Wp2__4gP7Z_7nE2Bqb0mPCGI-W252Mks-QSgQ8Qg49kDREA6mfWZxdENVxMm43pFv1W7rVM-mkvnOURcpZ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gCPH